PM London (Fri Dec 18 12:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/London","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM London (Fri Dec 18 12:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:H2e","a":"model","o":"Histria Soler","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/London","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM London (Fri Dec 18 12:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:H3","a":"model","o":"Histria Soler","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/London","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM London (Fri Dec 18 12:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Histria Soler","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:V7","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Visa or authorization in hand (Histria Soler)","d":"In the passport or confirmed valid for the whole trip.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Histria)","d":"Shoot is Thu Jan 7, 2027, 9:00 AM London at London studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Histria and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-24T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"test