ptions, charger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-01-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Europe/London","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM London (Mon Jan 18 12:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Histria)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Histria)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Histria Soler","t":"Arrival: Histria lands","d":"Landing in Paris. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-21T11:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Thu Jan 21, 12:00 PM Paris (Thu Jan 21 6:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":"Paris","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Histria Soler","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Histria)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-22T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Jan 22, 10:00 AM Paris (Fri Jan 22 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-22T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:histria-soler:DG","a":"model","o":"Histria Soler","t":"Digitals session (Histria)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-22T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Pari