aight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:olubiyi-omoshewa:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Olubiyi Omoshewa","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:olubiyi-omoshewa:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Olubiyi Omoshewa)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $8,019.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:olubiyi-omoshewa:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Olubiyi)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:olubiyi-omoshewa:TS2","a":"model","o":"Olubiyi Omoshewa","t":"Test shoot 2: Olubiyi","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-16T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Wed Dec 16, 9:00 AM Lagos (Wed Dec 16 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-16T16:00:00Z","loc":"Lagos studio","ek":""},{"i"