rger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-01-27T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Jan 27, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Jan 27 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Soni Lobodiuk","t":"Arrival: Soni lands","d":"Landing in New York. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-30T17:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Jan 30, 12:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":"New York","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:SK4","a":"model","o":"Soni Lobodiuk","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Soni Lobodiuk","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Soni Lobodiuk","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Soni)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 1, 10:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-01T15:45:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:DG","a":"model","o":"Soni Lobodiuk","t":"Digitals session (Soni)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-02-03T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Feb 3, 11:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-03T18:00:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Soni Lobodiuk)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-02-05T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Feb 5, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:soni-lobodiuk:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Soni Lobodiuk)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-02-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 8, 5:00 PM ET"}]},{"name":"Violeta Rodo","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-02-10","key_label":"New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14)","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Violeta. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Emma.","positioning":"Runway: New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14) (Wed Feb 10 to Tue Feb 16); Paris Women's FW27-28 (Mon Mar 1 to Tue Mar 9).","market":"Base: Lima. Shows: New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14), Paris Women's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Work-permit / entry status is being confirmed by Nov 13. Also pushing for editorial and campaigns.","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Violeta Rodo","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:G1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14), Paris Women's FW27-28.","u":"2026-11-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Nov 13 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:V1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Tell us your passport and work-permit status","d":"Send your passport photo page and the entry or work permits you already hold.","u":"2026-11-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Nov 13 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 16 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 16 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 16 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:V2","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Confirm US work authorization (Violeta Rodo)","d":"If something must be filed, file it by Nov 27 and add the case to the portal. If the model already has it, note the expiry.","u":"2026-11-17T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 17, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Violeta)","d":"Shoot is Wed Dec 2, 2026, 9:00 AM Lima at Lima studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Violeta and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:H1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Nov 20 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SKP","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: coastal humidity with strong UV. Use SPF 50 and reapply, a light moisturizer, and rinse salt and sweat off. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Wed Dec 2, 2026.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: ceviche, grilled chicken or fish, quinoa, lentils, avocado and fruit. Lighter lomo saltado is fine. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Wed Nov 25 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Violeta)","d":"Call sheet to Violeta and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lima, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Wed Dec 2, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-30T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 30, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 30 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Test shoot 1: Violeta","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lima studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-02T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Dec 2, 9:00 AM Lima (Wed Dec 2 9:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-02T22:00:00Z","loc":"Lima studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Violeta)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-04T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Violeta Rodo and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: New York Sat Jan 30 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $5,797 (flights $1,800, housing $1,920, meals and transport $1,310, transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-08T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 8, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Tue Dec 8, 5:00 PM Lima (Tue Dec 8 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $5,797. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $5,797","d":"Your season itinerary: New York Sat Jan 30 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $5,797: flights $1,800, housing $1,920, meals and local transport $1,310, airport transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, contingency $527. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 11 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 11 5:00 PM ET)","amt":5797},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $5,797).","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 11 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Violeta)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $5,797.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK2","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK2","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk video #2: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Dec 14 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Violeta)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:H2","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Travel health: ask your clinician about vaccines or medicines for your route, carry a copy of prescriptions, and bring your insurance card. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 18 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 18 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:H2e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 18 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:H3","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Dec 18 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Violeta)","d":"Shoot is Thu Jan 14, 2027, 9:00 AM Lima at Lima studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Violeta and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-31T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 31, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:CK1","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Mid-season check-in call with your agent","d":"30 minutes: how you feel, sleep, food, skin, walk and travel. Bring questions.","u":"2027-01-06T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"meeting","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Jan 6, 5:00 PM Lima (Wed Jan 6 5:00 PM ET)","en":"2027-01-06T22:30:00Z","loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Thu Jan 14, 2027.","u":"2027-01-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Violeta)","d":"Call sheet to Violeta and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lima, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2027-01-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Thu Jan 14, 2027. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2027-01-12T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Tue Jan 12, 5:00 PM Lima (Tue Jan 12 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Test shoot 2: Violeta","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lima studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2027-01-14T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Thu Jan 14, 9:00 AM Lima (Thu Jan 14 9:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-14T22:00:00Z","loc":"Lima studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Violeta)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2027-01-20T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 20, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-approve","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Approve your test shoot 2 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2027-01-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Jan 20, 5:00 PM Lima (Wed Jan 20 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:PA6","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm arrival date and emergency contact (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Arrival Sat Jan 30, 2027. Confirm the contact and, for anyone under 18, the guardian.","u":"2027-01-22T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-house","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Housing confirmed and address sent (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Confirm the bed, key pickup and house rules and send them to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-01-22T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:V7","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Visa or authorization in hand (Violeta Rodo)","d":"In the passport or confirmed valid for the whole trip.","u":"2027-01-22T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Violeta Rodo","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-01-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK3","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Violeta)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK3","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WK3e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk practice video #3 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Jan 25 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-ready","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Pre-flight check: documents, health and packing","d":"Passport, visa, tickets, insurance card, prescriptions, charger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-01-27T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Jan 27, 5:00 PM Lima (Wed Jan 27 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Violeta)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-27T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 27, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Arrival: Violeta lands","d":"Landing in New York. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-30T17:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Jan 30, 12:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":"New York","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Violeta)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 1, 10:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-01T15:45:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK4","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Feb 1 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Feb 1 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Feb 1 5:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:DG","a":"model","o":"Violeta Rodo","t":"Digitals session (Violeta)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-02-03T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Feb 3, 11:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-03T18:00:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-02-05T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Feb 5, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:violeta-rodo:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Violeta Rodo)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-02-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 8, 5:00 PM ET"}]}]}$json$;
  org uuid; boss uuid; mem jsonb := '{}'::jsonb;
  m jsonb; it jsonb; mid uuid; gp uuid; dp uuid; pa uuid; st text; r text;
  n_models int := 0; n_task int := 0; n_event int := 0; n_skip int := 0;
  miss text := ''; nomem text := ''; pmeta jsonb; ppfound boolean; n_ds int := 0;
begin
  select id into org from public.organizations where slug = 'maison-de-veux';
  if org is null then raise exception 'Organization maison-de-veux was not found'; end if;
  select id into boss from auth.users where lower(email) = 'demontez@maisondeveux.com';
  select coalesce(jsonb_object_agg(k, v), '{}'::jsonb) into mem from (
    select lower(split_part(pr.display_name, ' ', 1)) k, om.id::text v
    from public.organization_members om join public.profiles pr on pr.user_id = om.user_id
    where om.organization_id = org and om.member_type = 'staff' and om.status = 'active') s;

  for m in select * from jsonb_array_elements(p->'models') loop
    select id into mid from public.models where organization_id = org and pg_temp.nm(display_name) = pg_temp.nm(m->>'name') limit 1;
    if mid is null then miss := miss || (m->>'name') || '; '; continue; end if;
    n_models := n_models + 1;

    select id, development_plan_id, status into gp, dp, st from public.model_gameplans where organization_id = org and model_id = mid limit 1;
    if gp is null then
      insert into public.model_gameplans (organization_id, model_id, status, title, key_date, key_date_label, welcome_message, brand_positioning, market_focus, image_rules, risks, checkin_cadence, created_by)
      values (org, mid, 'active', m->'gp'->>'title', (m->'gp'->>'key_date')::date, m->'gp'->>'key_label', m->'gp'->>'welcome', m->'gp'->>'positioning',
              m->'gp'->>'market', m->'gp'->>'image_rules', m->'gp'->>'risks', m->'gp'->'cadence', boss)
      returning id into gp;
      dp := null;
    else
      update public.model_gameplans set status = 'active',
             title = coalesce(title, m->'gp'->>'title'), key_date = coalesce(key_date, (m->'gp'->>'key_date')::date),
             key_date_label = coalesce(key_date_label, m->'gp'->>'key_label'), welcome_message = coalesce(welcome_message, m->'gp'->>'welcome'),
             brand_positioning = coalesce(brand_positioning, m->'gp'->>'positioning'), market_focus = coalesce(market_focus, m->'gp'->>'market'),
             image_rules = coalesce(image_rules, m->'gp'->>'image_rules'), risks = coalesce(risks, m->'gp'->>'risks'), updated_at = now()
      where id = gp;
    end if;
    if dp is null then
      insert into public.development_plans (organization_id, model_id, title, status, starts_on, target_date, summary, metadata)
      values (org, mid, m->'gp'->>'title', 'active', date '2026-11-08', (m->'gp'->>'key_date')::date, m->'gp'->>'positioning',
              jsonb_build_object('source', 'smart_gameplan', 'gameplan_id', gp, 'plan', 'g90'))
      returning id into dp;
      update public.model_gameplans set development_plan_id = dp where id = gp;
    end if;

    -- daily routine blocks, habits and weekly items for the model's own DaySilk (kept beside their plan, so re-saving their answers never removes them)
    -- model_private_profiles has no id column: a row is identified by organization_id + model_id
    select metadata into pmeta from public.model_private_profiles where organization_id = org and model_id = mid limit 1;
    ppfound := found;
    pmeta := jsonb_set(coalesce(pmeta, '{}'::jsonb), '{daysilk}', coalesce(pmeta->'daysilk', '{}'::jsonb) || jsonb_build_object('gameplan', m->'ds'), true);
    if not ppfound then
      insert into public.model_private_profiles (organization_id, model_id, metadata) values (org, mid, pmeta);
    else
      update public.model_private_profiles set metadata = pmeta where organization_id = org and model_id = mid;
    end if;
    n_ds := n_ds + 1;

    select partner_agency_id into pa from public.model_placements
      where organization_id = org and model_id = mid and status in ('active', 'pending', 'placed') order by created_at desc limit 1;

    for it in select * from jsonb_array_elements(m->'items') loop
      r := pg_temp.gp_item(org, boss, mid, gp, pa, it, mem);
      if r = 'task' then n_task := n_task + 1;
      elsif r = 'event' then n_event := n_event + 1;
      elsif r like 'task:nomember:%' then n_task := n_task + 1; nomem := nomem || substr(r, 15) || ' ';
      else n_skip := n_skip + 1; end if;
    end loop;
  end loop;

  raise notice 'Models loaded: %. Tasks: %. Calendar events: %. DaySilk routine blocks written for: %. Skipped (no mother agency placement on file): %.', n_models, n_task, n_event, n_ds, n_skip;
  if miss <> '' then raise notice 'Models NOT found by name (fix the name in Models and run again): %', miss; end if;
  if nomem <> '' then raise notice 'Team names with no matching active staff (first names): %', (select string_agg(distinct x, ', ') from unnest(string_to_array(trim(nomem), ' ')) x); end if;
end $gp$;
